source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Translate pnpm-lock.yaml into Buck2 build rules

Usage: pudu [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init     Scaffold a pudu project
  config   Inspect pudu.toml
  vendor   Fetch tarballs and write pudu.lock. [UNIMPLEMENTED — S3]
  buckify  Emit BUCK, pudu.bzl, and config/BUCK. [UNIMPLEMENTED — S4]
  fixups   Manage the community fixup registry. [UNIMPLEMENTED — S7/S8]
  audit    Cross-check the lockfile against advisories. [UNIMPLEMENTED — Phase 2]
  unused   Report unreferenced vendored tarballs. [UNIMPLEMENTED — Phase 2]
  debug    Developer inspection commands
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -C <PATH>         Change to this directory before running
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v, -vv)
      --no-network  Forbid all network access. (No effect until S3.)
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
